      "spam": false,
      "value": "Peer to peer has huge privacy issues. With any peer to peer communication, ip addresses can be tracked from any peered device and given resources, may be able to track your real identity. I value privacy and would immediately quit the game if I realised peer to peer is used. Given the nature of the game, I'm sure nobody wants their identity known. This could be particularly bad for streamers.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
