      "spam": false,
      "value": "@{5a62fb2758aeea39060675bd|full_name}: I can't tell if you're trolling or just misinformed due to the extreme hype. Blockchains have a number of properties that fit this usecase very poorly. Such as being slow to synchronize, requiring a fixed order of downloads and being ever growing in disk space usage.\nA better idea would be https://ipfs.io/",
